00:00:10.420 --> 00:00:13.700
Galactic Shooting Star Silver
GINGA NAGAREBOSHI   GIN
SILVER  FANG

00:01:23.350 --> 00:01:27.100
<i>Reports from neighboring prefectures
say that a rogue bear -</i>

00:01:27.140 --> 00:01:29.310
<i>- is heading towards the mountains.</i>

00:01:29.310 --> 00:01:32.190
<i>That is raising concerns in the village.</i>

00:01:36.040 --> 00:01:40.450
<i>Akakabuto puts them under his
command, one by one.</i>

00:01:40.630 --> 00:01:45.750
<i>And like so, he increases
the defense around his castle.</i>

00:01:55.180 --> 00:02:00.060
<i>With hunting bow in hand, Daisuke and
Silver went towards the mountains.</i>

00:02:00.190 --> 00:02:04.680
<i>But they met a
mysterious pack of dogs.</i>

00:02:06.940 --> 00:02:10.650
<i>But in the moment of
danger, the leader appeared.</i>

00:02:10.870 --> 00:02:15.360
<i>The moment he saw the leader,
Silver's heart was moved.</i>

00:02:15.490 --> 00:02:20.920
<i>The leader made him feel a
warmth throughout his body.</i>

00:02:22.280 --> 00:02:29.040
HAND ON CHEST!
A MALES PROMISE IS SACRED

00:02:52.070 --> 00:02:55.570
Silver, don't do it!
You don't belong to them!

00:02:57.450 --> 00:03:00.320
<i>Daisuke's words didn't reach Silver.</i>

00:03:00.910 --> 00:03:04.530
<i>He was swept away by a force
that triggered his instincts.</i>

00:03:06.240 --> 00:03:09.870
<i>Why?
Why am I following them?</i>

00:03:10.870 --> 00:03:12.630
<i>What is it that attracts me?</i>

00:03:18.520 --> 00:03:20.760
Hurry up! Put some muscle into it!

00:03:37.370 --> 00:03:39.780
- He's following us!
- Ignore him!

00:03:39.950 --> 00:03:42.960
He can never keep up.

00:03:46.040 --> 00:03:49.160
Ben, he's still running after us!

00:03:49.300 --> 00:03:51.830
What? still?

00:03:53.510 --> 00:03:57.380
What a stubborn one!
I'll take care of him.

00:04:08.480 --> 00:04:13.480
Boy... only pack members are
allowed to run with us.

00:04:13.650 --> 00:04:15.610
Silver!

00:04:16.620 --> 00:04:22.740
- Silver! Where are you?
- Your master is looking for you.

00:04:25.080 --> 00:04:29.290
Don't throw away the happiness you have.

00:04:31.420 --> 00:04:36.170
- Go home!
- Silver, where are you?

00:04:37.140 --> 00:04:40.470
You okay? Are you unharmed?

00:04:40.600 --> 00:04:46.970
That's a releif. Let's go home
now, it will get dark soon.

00:05:10.880 --> 00:05:16.120
<i>Only pack members are
allowed to run with us!...</i>

00:05:20.760 --> 00:05:24.600
<i>Don't throw away the happiness you have.</i>

00:05:33.190 --> 00:05:38.700
I am so hungry, more!
The supper is delicious.

00:05:38.820 --> 00:05:42.990
Daisuke, where have you been all day?

00:05:43.160 --> 00:05:48.530
I trained Silver.
I promised grandfather Takeda.

00:05:49.250 --> 00:05:55.210
- Not the mountains again, did you?
- In the mountains? No...

00:05:55.510 --> 00:06:01.710
Doctor Hidetoshi says there
are wild dogs there now.

00:06:02.170 --> 00:06:04.050
Be careful!

00:06:07.100 --> 00:06:11.480
<i>Doctor Hidetoshi has
seen the wild dogs too...</i>

00:06:11.650 --> 00:06:16.810
<i>Amazing dogs!
They looked like regular hunting dogs.</i>

00:06:16.990 --> 00:06:21.110
<i>But... that one up on the cliff...</i>

00:06:24.200 --> 00:06:28.450
Fuji? Where is Silver?

00:06:32.130 --> 00:06:35.630
Fuji, has he... He can't have?

00:06:55.980 --> 00:06:56.720
What?

00:07:15.920 --> 00:07:17.830
Who's there?

00:07:21.050 --> 00:07:24.500
Incredibly fast as usual.
Right, Silver?

00:07:24.640 --> 00:07:31.010
- John! What are you doing here?
- Be quiet and follow me.

00:07:43.450 --> 00:07:47.610
- Who are they?
- No ordinary wild dogs.

00:07:47.790 --> 00:07:51.280
- We'll have to inspect a little.
- How?

00:07:51.460 --> 00:07:56.080
They will take us to their leader.

00:08:01.260 --> 00:08:03.210
Who's that?

00:08:07.600 --> 00:08:14.980
- Who's that? A domestic dog?
- No, he was with a hunter.

00:08:15.190 --> 00:08:19.980
Right, they dropped a giant bear.
Beware of him.

00:08:20.110 --> 00:08:25.270
Stop, John!
They are a bigger group.

00:08:25.950 --> 00:08:30.610
- Run along home then, boy.
- John!

00:08:34.040 --> 00:08:37.160
Does he want to fight?

00:08:42.470 --> 00:08:44.420
John!

00:08:53.930 --> 00:08:55.840
John...

00:08:56.650 --> 00:08:59.730
Stop tickling!

00:09:00.270 --> 00:09:05.020
Youngster, if you are gonna
fight, do it properly!

00:09:12.160 --> 00:09:14.490
Not bad.

00:09:14.750 --> 00:09:20.700
Beware, young dog.
Otherwise you won't come home alive.

00:09:28.090 --> 00:09:30.170
John!

00:09:36.770 --> 00:09:37.760
There as well!

00:09:38.930 --> 00:09:43.010
What's happening, Ben?
Who are they?

00:09:43.150 --> 00:09:47.230
Silver, we can't fight this many.
We have to escape.

00:09:47.360 --> 00:09:53.280
- We are surrounded.
- Ben, it would be fun to test them.

00:09:53.450 --> 00:09:56.700
<i>Test us? What does he mean?</i>

00:09:56.870 --> 00:10:01.910
- Do it, Ben!
- Don't interfere, Smith.

00:10:02.090 --> 00:10:05.870
<i>- Back to your post!
- Post?</i>

00:10:06.010 --> 00:10:09.670
You're supposed to watch them!

00:10:10.050 --> 00:10:13.500
Yeah, yeah...
Let's go, everyone.

00:10:15.680 --> 00:10:18.260
<i>Watch them?</i>

00:10:25.280 --> 00:10:32.740
- I'll test if you're a real male.
- Real male? You are not good enough.

00:10:33.030 --> 00:10:40.080
- Bring your leader here.
- We're gathering males for a mission.

00:10:40.210 --> 00:10:43.740
But only real males.

00:10:45.460 --> 00:10:49.510
If you defeat me,
you will meet the leader.

00:10:50.460 --> 00:10:54.170
Okay. Silver, don't interfere!

00:11:37.850 --> 00:11:39.640
What now?!

00:11:48.360 --> 00:11:50.400
That's?!

00:11:51.490 --> 00:11:54.690
It's Madara!

00:11:55.160 --> 00:11:57.320
What?

00:12:27.650 --> 00:12:34.770
- Damn Madara... He only killed one?
- Sorry, he ambushed us.

00:12:35.150 --> 00:12:39.270
- You should never leave your post.
- I'll get revenge!

00:12:39.540 --> 00:12:40.780
Don't, Cross?

00:12:41.910 --> 00:12:47.250
Did you forget leader's orders?
No more deaths.

00:12:48.040 --> 00:12:54.880
- So he should just get away with it?
- We'll avenge him one day, but not now.

00:12:58.600 --> 00:13:00.800
Run!

00:13:03.600 --> 00:13:09.690
What mission? Won't even
avenge a friend, damn cowards!

00:13:11.530 --> 00:13:19.110
- Silver, where're ya going, running away?
- No, I want to meet their leader.

00:13:27.170 --> 00:13:30.120
Be ready to jump everyone!

00:13:51.190 --> 00:13:54.730
<i>Did they jump over the valley?</i>

00:13:58.410 --> 00:14:03.070
Ben, the cub
wants to come along.

00:14:16.880 --> 00:14:21.180
Give up, boy!
You'll never make it!

00:14:21.600 --> 00:14:26.040
If you make it, I will acknowledge
you as a real male!

00:14:26.150 --> 00:14:30.540
- And you can meet our leader!
- What are you saying? He will die!

00:14:34.570 --> 00:14:38.020
What? So he didn't have
the guts to do it after all.

00:15:04.850 --> 00:15:07.720
He's gonna try!

00:15:10.020 --> 00:15:14.430
No, Silver!
You will never be able to jump over!

00:15:43.430 --> 00:15:45.470
No!

00:15:55.100 --> 00:15:57.350
<i>Silver jumped with all his might -</i>

00:15:57.350 --> 00:15:59.980
<i>- and used the wind blowing up
from the valley and -</i>

00:16:00.110 --> 00:16:01.940
<i>- floated through the air.</i>

00:16:07.540 --> 00:16:09.410
Silver?

00:16:09.500 --> 00:16:13.190
<i>His light body received so
much help from the wind -</i>

00:16:13.280 --> 00:16:16.070
<i>- that he flew much further
than the wild dogs.</i>

00:16:27.300 --> 00:16:33.180
- Impressive, kid!
- You promised to take me to your leader.

00:16:34.020 --> 00:16:35.640
The cub has good spirit!

00:16:35.800 --> 00:16:38.970
Did everyone see?
Any objections?

00:16:39.060 --> 00:16:42.180
- No, he's incredible!
- That's right!

00:16:42.350 --> 00:16:44.690
All right, you're a real male!

00:16:50.290 --> 00:16:51.350
Is it?

00:16:54.250 --> 00:16:56.020
Damn Madara!

00:17:14.520 --> 00:17:15.580
John!

00:17:36.670 --> 00:17:43.550
- John, hurry up and jump over!
- I never turn my back on the enemy!

00:17:43.710 --> 00:17:49.090
- I will not withdraw.
- What arrogance!

00:17:49.930 --> 00:17:55.680
A little bear...
I have been fighting African beasts!

00:17:58.850 --> 00:18:03.710
- Now what?
- It would be a shame to let him die.

00:18:10.660 --> 00:18:16.100
- I don't like that type of guys.
- But he's a real male.

00:18:17.210 --> 00:18:18.860
Cub, what are you doing?

00:18:21.500 --> 00:18:24.110
Don't! You can't do anything!

00:18:32.220 --> 00:18:36.410
Remember your promise:
I'll meet your leader!

00:18:54.580 --> 00:18:58.400
- John, how are you?
- I'm just a little out of breath.

00:18:58.560 --> 00:19:01.400
You may not want it,
but I'll help!

00:19:05.170 --> 00:19:08.490
No, Silver!
He's not like other bears, he's tough!

00:19:20.230 --> 00:19:26.090
What a cub! We must do something.
Come on everyone, he can't die here!

00:19:26.590 --> 00:19:32.090
He is a real male!
And we need him.

00:19:34.500 --> 00:19:40.230
- Hurry, he's in danger.
- Don't worry. We'll take care of this.

00:19:40.630 --> 00:19:42.810
First Pluton!

00:19:46.050 --> 00:19:47.820
Second pluton!

00:19:52.970 --> 00:19:55.330
Third Pluton! Stop him!

00:20:12.950 --> 00:20:15.020
Wait! Just let him run!

00:20:16.360 --> 00:20:19.310
That he actually survived all that!

00:20:19.730 --> 00:20:23.780
- You all right, John?
- Why ask? It's just a scratch.

00:20:23.920 --> 00:20:28.560
- Let's greet each other again, friend.
- Friend?

00:20:29.670 --> 00:20:33.120
I'm Ben, the leader
of the first platoon.

00:20:33.260 --> 00:20:39.430
- Leader of the second platoon, Great.
- I'm the leader of third, Smith!

00:20:39.600 --> 00:20:47.130
- Also known as the girl hunter Smith.
- Cross, bitches should just shut up!

00:20:47.220 --> 00:20:53.570
Don't treat me like a bitch! Do you want
to see who's the strongest of us two?

00:20:53.700 --> 00:20:55.520
Stop!

00:20:57.530 --> 00:21:01.450
- I'm Silver.
- John, nice to meet you.

00:21:01.660 --> 00:21:08.280
We have twelve plutons.
They're all out on assignments.

00:21:08.460 --> 00:21:14.650
- Ben, can I see your leader?
- Sure thing, cub. I mean Silver.

00:21:14.990 --> 00:21:17.630
You are real males, so follow me.

00:21:26.020 --> 00:21:29.310
The leader is calling for us!

00:21:45.620 --> 00:21:48.110
<i>This scent...</i>

00:22:24.450 --> 00:22:28.560
<i>Silver felt something
unforgettable in the scent.</i>

00:22:30.380 --> 00:22:36.750
<i>"Is it?..."
Silver hastily swallows the words.</i>

00:22:38.330 --> 00:22:44.130
<i>"It can't be..."
Silver was stunned by wonder.</i>
